From: yuzu <yuzu23234@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] sensors: apply online vector calibration to raw samples

The DSP sensor core continuously estimates gyroscope bias and magnetometer
matrix calibration, then broadcasts these updates via dedicated report
messages. When available, apply the current bias and matrix to raw samples
so clients receive calibrated data without userspace tuning tools.

